{"seq":1,"slug":"tsc-and-typescript-compilation","title":"tsc 与 TypeScript 编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/tsc-and-typescript-compilation","wordCount":793,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"tsc-与-typescript-编译\">tsc 与 TypeScript 编译</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>tsc 同时承担两件性质不同的事：类型检查和代码生成。在现代工具链中这两者常被拆开——tsc 用 <code>noEmit</code> 只做类型校验，代码生成交给 SWC 或 esbuild——因此理解 tsc 的完整编译管线（Scanner → Parser → Binder → Checker → Emitter）比会写配置更重要。<code>isolatedModules</code> 与项目引用（Project References）是这条拆分路线上最关键的两个约束，它们决定了哪些代码能被单文件转译器安全处理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-编译器的角色\">TypeScript 编译器的角色</h2><p>TypeScript 编译器（tsc）是 TypeScript 生态的核心。它承担着两个截然不同但同等重要的职责：<strong>类型检查</strong>和<strong>代码生成</strong>。在现代构建工具链中，这两个职责往往被分离到不同的工具中——tsc 专注于类型检查，而 SWC 或 esbuild 负责代码生成——但理解 tsc 的完整编译流程仍然是掌握 TypeScript 的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    SRC[TypeScript 源码]&#10;    subgraph tsc 编译管线&#10;        SCANNER[Scanner&lt;br/&gt;词法分析]&#10;        PARSER[Parser&lt;br/&gt;语法分析]&#10;        BINDER[Binder&lt;br/&gt;符号绑定]&#10;        CHECKER[Type Checker&lt;br/&gt;类型检查]&#10;        EMITTER[Emitter&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]&#10;    end&#10;    JS[JavaScript 输出]&#10;    DTS[.d.ts 声明文件]&#10;    ERRORS[类型错误报告]&#10;&#10;    SRC --&gt; SCANNER --&gt; PARSER --&gt; BINDER --&gt; CHECKER&#10;    CHECKER --&gt; EMITTER&#10;    CHECKER --&gt; ERRORS&#10;    EMITTER --&gt; JS&#10;    EMITTER --&gt; DTS\">flowchart LR\n    SRC[TypeScript 源码]\n    subgraph tsc 编译管线\n        SCANNER[Scanner&lt;br/&gt;词法分析]\n        PARSER[Parser&lt;br/&gt;语法分析]\n        BINDER[Binder&lt;br/&gt;符号绑定]\n        CHECKER[Type Checker&lt;br/&gt;类型检查]\n        EMITTER[Emitter&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]\n    end\n    JS[JavaScript 输出]\n    DTS[.d.ts 声明文件]\n    ERRORS[类型错误报告]\n\n    SRC --&gt; SCANNER --&gt; PARSER --&gt; BINDER --&gt; CHECKER\n    CHECKER --&gt; EMITTER\n    CHECKER --&gt; ERRORS\n    EMITTER --&gt; JS\n    EMITTER --&gt; DTS</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tsconfig-json-核心配置\">tsconfig.json 核心配置</h2><p>tsconfig.json 是 TypeScript 项目的配置中心。理解其中的关键选项对于正确配置构建工具链至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"编译目标与模块系统\">编译目标与模块系统</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ES2020&quot;,&#10;    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;ESNext&quot;,&#10;    &quot;moduleResolution&quot;: &quot;bundler&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lib&quot;: [&quot;ES2020&quot;, &quot;DOM&quot;, &quot;DOM.Iterable&quot;],&#10;    &quot;esModuleInterop&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;allowSyntheticDefaultImports&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;isolatedModules&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ES2020\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ESNext\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moduleResolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bundler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lib\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ES2020\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DOM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DOM.Iterable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"esModuleInterop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"allowSyntheticDefaultImports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"isolatedModules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>target</code></td>\n<td>JS 输出版本</td>\n<td><code>ES2020</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>module</code></td>\n<td>模块系统</td>\n<td><code>ESNext</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>moduleResolution</code></td>\n<td>模块解析策略</td>\n<td><code>bundler</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lib</code></td>\n<td>可用的类型声明库</td>\n<td>根据目标环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isolatedModules</code></td>\n<td>确保每个文件可独立转译</td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>moduleResolution: &quot;bundler&quot;</code> 是 TypeScript 5.0 引入的新模式，它匹配现代打包器的解析行为——支持 <code>package.json</code> 的 <code>exports</code> 字段、允许省略扩展名等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"严格模式配置\">严格模式配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;noUncheckedIndexedAccess&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;noImplicitOverride&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;exactOptionalPropertyTypes&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;noFallthroughCasesInSwitch&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noImplicitOverride\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exactOptionalPropertyTypes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>strict: true</code> 是一个元选项，它启用了以下所有严格检查：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    STRICT[&quot;strict: true&quot;]&#10;    A[strictNullChecks]&#10;    B[strictFunctionTypes]&#10;    C[strictBindCallApply]&#10;    D[strictPropertyInitialization]&#10;    E[noImplicitAny]&#10;    F[noImplicitThis]&#10;    G[alwaysStrict]&#10;    H[useUnknownInCatchVariables]&#10;&#10;    STRICT --&gt; A&#10;    STRICT --&gt; B&#10;    STRICT --&gt; C&#10;    STRICT --&gt; D&#10;    STRICT --&gt; E&#10;    STRICT --&gt; F&#10;    STRICT --&gt; G&#10;    STRICT --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    STRICT[\"strict: true\"]\n    A[strictNullChecks]\n    B[strictFunctionTypes]\n    C[strictBindCallApply]\n    D[strictPropertyInitialization]\n    E[noImplicitAny]\n    F[noImplicitThis]\n    G[alwaysStrict]\n    H[useUnknownInCatchVariables]\n\n    STRICT --&gt; A\n    STRICT --&gt; B\n    STRICT --&gt; C\n    STRICT --&gt; D\n    STRICT --&gt; E\n    STRICT --&gt; F\n    STRICT --&gt; G\n    STRICT --&gt; H</pre><h3 id=\"路径映射与别名\">路径映射与别名</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseUrl&quot;: &quot;.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;@/*&quot;: [&quot;src/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@components/*&quot;: [&quot;src/components/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@hooks/*&quot;: [&quot;src/hooks/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@utils/*&quot;: [&quot;src/utils/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@types/*&quot;: [&quot;src/types/*&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@components/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/components/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@hooks/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/hooks/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@utils/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/utils/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@types/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/types/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>路径映射只影响 tsc 的类型解析，不影响运行时。打包器需要配置对应的 alias 来实现实际的路径解析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"声明文件生成\">声明文件生成</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationDir&quot;: &quot;dist/types&quot;,&#10;    &quot;emitDeclarationOnly&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"emitDeclarationOnly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"仅类型检查模式\">仅类型检查模式</h2><p>在现代构建流水线中，tsc 通常以&quot;仅类型检查&quot;模式运行，不负责实际的代码生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"tsc --noEmit\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --noEmit</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 现代构建流水线&#10;        TSC[tsc --noEmit&lt;br/&gt;类型检查]&#10;        SWC[SWC / esbuild&lt;br/&gt;代码转译]&#10;        BUNDLER[Bundler&lt;br/&gt;打包]&#10;    end&#10;    SRC[TS 源码] --&gt; TSC&#10;    SRC --&gt; SWC&#10;    TSC --&gt;|类型错误报告| DEV[开发者]&#10;    SWC --&gt; BUNDLER --&gt; OUTPUT[产物]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 现代构建流水线\n        TSC[tsc --noEmit&lt;br/&gt;类型检查]\n        SWC[SWC / esbuild&lt;br/&gt;代码转译]\n        BUNDLER[Bundler&lt;br/&gt;打包]\n    end\n    SRC[TS 源码] --&gt; TSC\n    SRC --&gt; SWC\n    TSC --&gt;|类型错误报告| DEV[开发者]\n    SWC --&gt; BUNDLER --&gt; OUTPUT[产物]</pre><p>这种分离的好处：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>tsc 单独执行</th>\n<th>SWC/esbuild 执行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>完整的语义分析</td>\n<td>不做类型检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转译速度</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特性支持</td>\n<td>所有 TS 特性</td>\n<td>大部分特性（有限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行能力</td>\n<td>单线程</td>\n<td>多线程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"isolatedmodules-的重要性\">isolatedModules 的重要性</h2><p>当使用非 tsc 转译器（如 SWC、esbuild）时，<code>isolatedModules: true</code> 是必须的。因为这些工具逐文件转译，无法获取跨文件的类型信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 以下写法在 isolatedModules 下会报错&#10;// 因为转译器无法判断 MyType 是类型还是值&#10;export { MyType } from &#39;./types&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 正确写法 - 明确标记为类型导出&#10;export type { MyType } from &#39;./types&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 或使用 import type&#10;import type { MyType } from &#39;./types&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 以下写法在 isolatedModules 下会报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 因为转译器无法判断 MyType 是类型还是值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MyType } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确写法 - 明确标记为类型导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MyType } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或使用 import type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MyType } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// const enum 在 isolatedModules 下也有限制&#10;// 因为内联替换需要跨文件信息&#10;const enum Direction {&#10;  Up,&#10;  Down,&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 应改为普通 enum&#10;enum Direction {&#10;  Up,&#10;  Down,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// const enum 在 isolatedModules 下也有限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 因为内联替换需要跨文件信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Up</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Down</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 应改为普通 enum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Up</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Down</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"项目引用-project-references\">项目引用（Project References）</h2><p>对于 Monorepo 或大型项目，TypeScript 的项目引用可以实现增量编译和并行构建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// tsconfig.json (根目录)&#10;{&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;references&quot;: [{ &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./packages/core&quot; }, { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./packages/ui&quot; }, { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./packages/utils&quot; }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tsconfig.json (根目录)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./packages/core\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./packages/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./packages/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// packages/core/tsconfig.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;dist&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;references&quot;: [{ &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../utils&quot; }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/core/tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"composite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 增量构建所有项目&#10;tsc --build&#10;&#10;# 并行构建&#10;tsc --build --verbose\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 增量构建所有项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 并行构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ROOT[根 tsconfig.json]&#10;    CORE[packages/core]&#10;    UI[packages/ui]&#10;    UTILS[packages/utils]&#10;&#10;    ROOT --&gt; CORE&#10;    ROOT --&gt; UI&#10;    ROOT --&gt; UTILS&#10;    CORE --&gt; UTILS&#10;    UI --&gt; CORE&#10;    UI --&gt; UTILS\">graph TD\n    ROOT[根 tsconfig.json]\n    CORE[packages/core]\n    UI[packages/ui]\n    UTILS[packages/utils]\n\n    ROOT --&gt; CORE\n    ROOT --&gt; UI\n    ROOT --&gt; UTILS\n    CORE --&gt; UTILS\n    UI --&gt; CORE\n    UI --&gt; UTILS</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tsc-与打包器的协作模式\">tsc 与打包器的协作模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-tsc-全权负责-传统方式\">模式一：tsc 全权负责（传统方式）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"tsc &amp;&amp; node dist/index.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tsc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist/index.js</span></span></code></pre></div><p>适用于简单的 Node.js 项目，不需要打包。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-tsc-类型检查-swc-转译-推荐\">模式二：tsc 类型检查 + SWC 转译（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: &quot;tsc --noEmit&quot;,&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;rsbuild build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;rsbuild dev&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsc --noEmit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rsbuild build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rsbuild dev\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式三-tsc-生成声明文件-打包器构建\">模式三：tsc 生成声明文件 + 打包器构建</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build:types&quot;: &quot;tsc --emitDeclarationOnly&quot;,&#10;    &quot;build:js&quot;: &quot;rollup -c&quot;,&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;npm run build:types &amp;&amp; npm run build:js&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build:types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsc --emitDeclarationOnly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build:js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rollup -c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npm run build:types &#x26;&#x26; npm run build:js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>tsc 承担类型检查和代码生成两大职责，现代工具链通常分离这两个职责。</li>\n<li><code>moduleResolution: &quot;bundler&quot;</code> 匹配现代打包器的模块解析行为。</li>\n<li><code>isolatedModules: true</code> 在使用非 tsc 转译器时是必须的。</li>\n<li>项目引用（Project References）支持 Monorepo 的增量编译。</li>\n<li>推荐模式：tsc --noEmit 做类型检查，SWC/esbuild 做代码转译。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"tsc 与 TypeScript 编译","id":"tsc-与-typescript-编译"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeScript 编译器的角色","id":"typescript-编译器的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"tsconfig.json 核心配置","id":"tsconfig-json-核心配置"},{"level":3,"text":"编译目标与模块系统","id":"编译目标与模块系统"},{"level":3,"text":"严格模式配置","id":"严格模式配置"},{"level":3,"text":"路径映射与别名","id":"路径映射与别名"},{"level":3,"text":"声明文件生成","id":"声明文件生成"},{"level":2,"text":"仅类型检查模式","id":"仅类型检查模式"},{"level":2,"text":"isolatedModules 的重要性","id":"isolatedmodules-的重要性"},{"level":2,"text":"项目引用（Project References）","id":"项目引用-project-references"},{"level":2,"text":"tsc 与打包器的协作模式","id":"tsc-与打包器的协作模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：tsc 全权负责（传统方式）","id":"模式一-tsc-全权负责-传统方式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：tsc 类型检查 + SWC 转译（推荐）","id":"模式二-tsc-类型检查-swc-转译-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：tsc 生成声明文件 + 打包器构建","id":"模式三-tsc-生成声明文件-打包器构建"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"esbuild 极速构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/esbuild"},"next":{"title":"Babel 与 SWC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/babel-and-swc"}}